<title>UK: ScotPower yr pretax profits up 38 pct.</title>
<headline>ScotPower yr pretax profits up 38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		38.11		  vs 33.12</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 18.50		  vs 15.50</p>
<p> Pretax		     558.4		  vs 404.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,940.7		vs 2,271.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 538.3 and 582 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Scottish Power Plc</p>
</text>
